%N A399826 Number of labeled graphs whose family of open neighborhoods is connected.
%C A399826 The family of open neighborhoods of a graph G is {N_G(v) : v in V(G)}. It is connected if its intersection graph is connected, where two members are adjacent when they have nonempty intersection.
%C A399826 Equivalently, these are the connected nonbipartite labeled graphs.
%F A399826 a(0) = 0; for n >= 1, a(n) = A001187(n) - A001832(n).
%e A399826 a(3) = 1, corresponding to K_3, the only connected nonbipartite graph on 3 labeled vertices.
%Y A399826 Cf. A001187 (labeled connected graphs), A001832 (labeled connected bipartite graphs).
%K A399826 nonn,new
%O A399826 0,5
